  "build": "vite build"
}
If vite is missing from that list, the "command not found" error will never go away.

2. The "Clean" Install Command
In your Vercel Settings > General, try changing the Install Command to this (it's a bit more aggressive):

npm install --include=dev --legacy-peer-deps

