3. Check the "Framework Preset" one more time
In your earlier screenshot, you had it set to Vite.

Try toggling it to Other and then back to Vite.

This sometimes "wakes up" Vercel and makes it reset the paths.

Save immediately after doing this.

4. The "Nuclear" Option (Move your files)
If the above fails, it means the folder structure is just too deep for Vercel to handle on mobile.

Go to GitHub.

Take all the files inside the frontend folder and move them to the Main/Root folder.

Delete the empty frontend folder.

Change the Vercel Root Directory setting back to ./.

