Found it! The "Unexpected character" is a stray closing brace } sitting right in the middle of your file, immediately after your scripts section. This essentially "cut the wire" and told Vercel the file was finished while there was still half a page of code left.

You also had some duplicate entries for react and react-dom (versions 18 and 19), which can cause headaches later.

